{"sha": "d0a59bec35ee2f26b77696cf01fddf99114122283a1bee659a822036300e6a73", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:boltzmann-factor} 章 --- 玻尔兹曼因子}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:1}", "$H = k_BT/mg = \\qty{8.4}{km}$；\\qty{0.70}{}、\\qty{0.35}{}、\\qty{0.30}{bar}（实际为", "\\qty{0.26}{}：空气随高度降温）；氦为 \\qty{61}{km}；火星为", "\\qty{10.7}{km}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:2}", "氢：$4\\eu^{-395} \\approx 10^{-171}$；$4\\eu^{-19.7} = 10^{-8}$；$4\\eu^{-11.8} = 3 \\times", "10^{-5}$。钠：$\\eu^{-9.8} = 6 \\times 10^{-5}$。转动：$\\eu^{-0.04} = 0.96$，几乎", "相等。核自旋：$1 - 4 \\times 10^{-6}$ --- 磁共振所依赖的", "微小极化。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:3}", "N$_2$ \\qty{300}{K}: \\qty{422}{}, \\qty{476}{}, \\qty{517}{m/s}; \\qty{77}{K}: \\qty{214}{}, \\qty{241}{},", "\\qty{262}{m/s}；H$_2$：\\qty{1580}{}、\\qty{1780}{}、\\qty{1930}{m/s}；烟粒子：", "\\qty{9}{cm/s}（其布朗颤动）。速率超过 $2v_{\\text{p}}$ 的分子约占", "二十分之一；超过 $3v_{\\text{p}}$ 的约为 $2500$ 分之一 --- 每立方米仍有 $10^{22}$ 个。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:4}", "$x = 2.2 \\times 10^{-3}$ 和 $0.67$；$M/M_{\\text{sat}} = 2.2 \\times 10^{-3}$ 和 $0.59$；", "$M_{\\text{sat}} = n\\mu = \\qty{9.3e4}{A/m}$; $\\chi = \\mu_0n\\mu^2/k_BT = 2.6 \\times 10^{-4}$.", "铁的 \\qty{1.7e6}{A/m} 是协同效应，而非玻尔兹曼效应。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:5}", "(a) \\cref{prop:b2:boltzmann-factor:twolevel}。(b) $\\eu^{-x} < 1$，只要 $T > 0$；", "$N_2 > N_1$ 需要 $T < 0$ --- 即粒子数反转。(c) $0$ 与", "$Nk_B\\ln 2$。(d) $x = 1.93$ 时为 $0.13$；在 \\qty{77}{K} 下 $x = 7.5$，为 $5 \\times 10^{-4}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:6}", "(a) $N\\varepsilon/(\\eu^x + 1)$ 的导数。(b) $x = 2.40$，$C = 0.44\\,Nk_B$。", "(c) $\\propto x^2\\eu^{-x} \\to 0$：冻结；$\\propto 1/T^2 \\to 0$：两能级均已填满，", "无可吸收。(d) $k_BT = 0.42\\varepsilon$：\\qty{0.5}{mK}；低于", "一毫开尔文时，核自旋承载了大部分热容，并", "使每一次降温都变得缓慢。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:7}", "(a) \\cref{thm:b2:boltzmann-factor:equipartition}。(b) $\\tfrac32R$，", "$\\tfrac52R$。(c) $C_{\\text{vib}}/R = x^2\\eu^x/(\\eu^x - 1)^2$：$0.002$、$0.41$、$0.90$；", "$C_V = 2.50R$、$2.91R$、$3.40R$。(d) $0.92$、$0.30$、$0.995$；金刚石 $x = 4.3$：", "$0.26 \\times 3R = \\qty{6.5}{J/mol/K}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:8}", "(a)、(b) \\cref{thm:b2:boltzmann-factor:maxwell}。(c) $\\tfrac32k_BT$。(d)", "$\\tfrac14n\\langle v\\rangle = \\qty{2.9e27}{m^{-2}.s^{-1}}$：每平方", "厘米每秒 $3 \\times 10^{23}$ 个；通过 \\qty{7.9e-13}{m^2} 的小孔：$2.3 \\times 10^{15}$", "个分子每秒，即泄漏率为 $\\qty{1e-5}{Pa.m^3/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:9}", "(a) 对 $f$ 分部积分；主项为 $(2/\\sqrt\\pi)x\\eu^{-x^2}$。(b)", "氦 $x = 5.5$：$5 \\times 10^{-13}$；氮 $x = 14.5$：$\\eu^{-211}$。(c) $x =", "4.9$：每碰撞时间 $10^{-10}$ --- 已消失；$10^{-17}$ 需 $x \\approx 6.6$，", "$T \\lesssim \\qty{230}{K}$。(d) $x = 11$：$\\eu^{-121}$；足够冷。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:10}", "(a) $n = n_0\\eu^{m\\omega^2r^2/2k_BT}$。(b) $\\eu^{\\Delta m\\omega^2r^2/2k_BT} = \\eu^{0.24} =", "1.27$。(c) $H = k_BT/m'g = \\qty{16}{\\micro m}$；在", "几个高度上计数小球，可得 $k_B$，进而 $N_A = R/k_B$。(d) 离子在电荷周围服从", "$\\eu^{\\mp e\\varphi/k_BT}$；对泊松方程作线性化，", "得 $\\varphi'' = \\varphi/\\lambda_{\\text{D}}^2$：势在", "$\\lambda_{\\text{D}}$ 之外被屏蔽。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:11}", "(a) $Z = 1/(1 - \\eu^{-x})$，$\\langle E\\rangle = h\\nu/(\\eu^x - 1)$。(b) $k_BT$：", "能量均分；$h\\nu\\eu^{-h\\nu/k_BT}$：冻结。(c) $u_\\nu = (8\\pi\\nu^2/c^3)\\langle E", "\\rangle$；瑞利--金斯给出每个模式 $k_BT$。(d) 一个模式", "不能被小于一个量子的能量激发。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:boltzmann-factor:12}", "(a) 仅 $x = \\mu B/k_BT$；$\\ln 2$ 与 $0$。(b) $x = 0.67$ 时 $S/Nk_B = 0.51$，故", "每移除一个自旋约 $0.18\\,k_B$。(c) $B/T$ 不变：\\qty{10}{mK}。(d) 自旋自身的", "场（毫特斯拉）在末段取代 $B$，并限制降温；", "测量 $M = n\\mu\\tanh(\\mu B/k_BT)$ 即可得 $T$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:boltzmann-factor:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\dd P/\\dd z = -nmg = -(mg/k_BT)P$; $H = \\qty{8.4}{km}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\eu^{-mgz/k_BT}$：一个分子的势能，", "空气的温度。", "", "\\textbf{3.} \\qty{0.70}{}, \\qty{0.52}{}, \\qty{0.35}{bar}; $H\\ln 2 = \\qty{5.8}{km}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $P_0/g = \\qty{1.03e4}{kg/m^2}$; $\\times 4\\pi R^2$: \\qty{5.3e18}{kg}; $\\rho_0H =", "1.22 \\times 8400 = \\qty{1.03e4}{kg/m^2}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $5.3 \\times 10^{18}/(29 \\times 10^{-3}/N_A) = 1.1 \\times 10^{44}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $H_{\\text{O}_2} = 7.6$，$H_{\\text{N}_2} = \\qty{8.7}{km}$：在 \\qty{50}{km} 处的比值", "将是其地面值的 $\\eu^{-50/7.6 + 50/8.7} = 0.44$ 倍；湍流", "混合的速度快于扩散的分离。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 更低：冷空气更稠密，压强下降得更快。", "", "\\textbf{8.} \\qty{2.5e25}{m^{-3}}；$\\eu^{-11.9}$：\\qty{1.7e20}{m^{-3}} --- 无明显边界，只是", "一种约定。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $11.2\\sqrt{6370/6870} = \\qty{10.8}{km/s}$.", ""]}